sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant S as Sender
    participant R as Empty replica
    participant C as Nodes closest to the DID
    S->>R: STORE(key, record at position N)
    Note over R: the record proves its own key,<br/>but a higher position may exist
    rect rgba(192, 57, 43, 0.07)
    opt record not in form, or its key not in the tree at N
        R-->>S: InvalidRecord, nobody asked
    end
    end
    R->>C: FindHash(key) to all of them at once, deadline 2 s
    C-->>R: position and SHA-256 of their record, or closer nodes
    opt some nodes claim a position above N
        R->>C: FindValue(key), one per distinct claim,<br/>to the closest node that made it, at most k − 1, at once
        C-->>R: their record, or nothing
        Note over R: a record counts if it hashes to the claim,<br/>is in the tree at a higher position<br/>and its signature verifies
    end
    alt a higher record verified
        rect rgba(201, 138, 27, 0.10)
        Note over R: store the higher record
        R-->>S: Stale
        end
    else none: claims not shown, silence, or nobody to ask
        rect rgba(47, 143, 78, 0.10)
        Note over R: verify the signature of the record sent,<br/>then insert it if still absent
        R-->>S: Stored
        end
    end
